msgstr "组与项顺序、张量维度、历史长度、单位、坐标系、限幅和扰动行为。"

#: source/how-to/transfer_policies_between_physx_and_newton.rst:57
msgid "Policy state"
msgstr "策略状态"

#: source/how-to/transfer_policies_between_physx_and_newton.rst:58
