msgstr "物理 ``dt`` 、控制降采样倍数、策略周期和动作保持行为。同一策略周期内，Newton 子步数可以不同。"

#: source/how-to/transfer_policies_between_physx_and_newton.rst:63
msgid "Mechanism"
msgstr "机械结构"

#: source/how-to/transfer_policies_between_physx_and_newton.rst:64
msgid ""
"Ordered bodies and joints, active degrees of freedom, and mimic or equality "
"coupling."
msgstr "有序刚体与关节、主动自由度，以及 mimic 或等式耦合。"

#: source/how-to/transfer_policies_between_physx_and_newton.rst:65
msgid "Episode"
msgstr "回合"

#: source/how-to/transfer_policies_between_physx_and_newton.rst:66
msgid ""
